0324: tap to wake (tester bug 5). SweetFramebuffer exports the panel state (sweet_fb_panel_off, set where RequestPowerChange
turns the panel off/on); sweet_touch turns two quick still taps while the panel is off (second down within 400 ms of the first
lift, within 120 px; each under 250 ms, moved < 40 px, not within 60 px of an edge nor on the fingerprint circle; one finger)
into a side-button press, sweet_hid_key(0, 1/0) 50 ms apart. Not before the panel has been off 1 s; 1.5 s cooldown.
kern.sweet_tap_wake / boot-arg sweettapwake: 0 off, 1 single tap, 2 double tap (default); kern.sweet_tap_wakes counts.
Tap filter after telegdyd hakios inject.c dd78da76 (MIT); code ours.

